   {"role": "heading", "text": "Part A. Multiple choice (2 points each)"},
   {"role": "body", "text": "1. Which of the following is a renewable energy source?"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "a) Coal"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "b) Natural gas"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "c) Solar power"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "d) Uranium"},
   {"role": "body", "text": "2. The main greenhouse gas released by burning fossil fuels is"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "a) methane"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "b) carbon dioxide"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "c) ozone"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "d) nitrogen"},
   {"role": "body", "text": "3. A food chain always begins with"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "a) a producer"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "b) a herbivore"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "c) a decomposer"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "d) a carnivore"},
   {"role": "body", "text": "4. Which process returns nitrogen gas to the atmosphere?"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "a) Nitrogen fixation"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "b) Denitrification"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "c) Photosynthesis"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "d) Respiration"},
   {"role": "body", "text": "5. The variety of living things in an area is called"},
